              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelin, light armour and shield. May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). Warband. Army General. 0-1. (Shieldwall p.61)</characteristic>
