              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons. May have shield (+2 pts) or additional hand weapon (+3 pts). May have throwing spear (+2 pts), double-handed axe (+3 pts) and javelins (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Fury of the Norsemen. Subject to Warband psychology rule 2. Different Weapons. 0-1 unit. Dogs of War cannot be accompanied by characters and cannot benefit from the Army General and Standard Bearer rules. (Shieldwall p.78)</characteristic>
